## Input 바인딩 패턴

### 1. 탭 이벤트

```swift
// UIButton
self.rootView.button.rx.tap
    .bind(to: input.buttonTap)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// UIBarButtonItem
self.navigationItem.rightBarButtonItem?.rx.tap
    .bind(to: input.rightBarButtonTap)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 2. 라이프사이클 이벤트

```swift
self.rx.viewDidAppear
    .bind(to: input.viewDidAppear)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

self.rx.viewWillDisappear
    .bind(to: input.viewWillDisappear)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 3. 값 매핑

```swift
// Enum 값 매핑
self.rootView.eblButton.rx.tap
    .map { EblVrmContentsType.primaryHoldFirst }
    .bind(to: input.eblVrmType)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// 복잡한 값 변환
self.rootView.segmentedControl.rx.selectedSegmentIndex
    .map { index -> FilterType in
        switch index {
        case 0: return .all
        case 1: return .active
        default: return .inactive
        }
    }
    .bind(to: input.filterType)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 4. 값 변경 이벤트

```swift
// UISwitch
self.rootView.switchView.rx.isOn
    .bind(to: input.isSwitchOn)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// UISlider
self.rootView.slider.rx.value
    .map { Int($0) }
    .bind(to: input.sliderValue)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 5. TableView/CollectionView 선택

```swift
// 단일 선택
self.rootView.tableView.rx.modelSelected(MyModel.self)
    .bind(to: input.itemTap)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// IndexPath와 모델 동시 전달
Observable.zip(
    self.rootView.tableView.rx.itemSelected,
    self.rootView.tableView.rx.modelSelected(MyModel.self)
)
.bind { [weak self] indexPath, model in
    self?.rootView.tableView.deselectRow(at: indexPath, animated: true)
    input.itemTap.accept(model)
}
.disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 6. TextField 텍스트

```swift
// 일반 텍스트
self.rootView.textField.rx.text
    .orEmpty
    .bind(to: input.searchText)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// 디바운스 적용
self.rootView.searchTextField.rx.text
    .orEmpty
    .debounce(.milliseconds(300), scheduler: MainScheduler.instance)
    .bind(to: input.searchQuery)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 7. 중복 제거

```swift
self.rootView.cameraChanged
    .distinctUntilChanged()
    .bind(to: input.cameraChanged)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 8. 여러 Input 결합

```swift
// combineLatest
Observable.combineLatest(
    self.rootView.nameTextField.rx.text.orEmpty,
    self.rootView.emailTextField.rx.text.orEmpty
)
.map { name, email in
    FormData(name: name, email: email)
}
.bind(to: input.formData)
.disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// merge
Observable.merge(
    self.rootView.backButton.rx.tap.map { _ in },
    self.rootView.closeButton.rx.tap.map { _ in }
)
.bind(to: input.dismiss)
.disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

