## Output 바인딩 패턴

### 1. 텍스트 바인딩

```swift
// UILabel
output.userName
    .bind(to: self.rootView.label.rx.text)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// UIButton 타이틀
output.buttonTitle
    .bind(to: self.rootView.button.rx.title(for: .normal))
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 2. 복잡한 UI 업데이트

```swift
// View의 Binder 활용 (권장)
output.itemData
    .bind(to: self.rootView.itemData)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// 클로저 직접 사용
output.itemData
    .bind { [weak self] data in
        self?.rootView.updateItemInfo(data)
    }
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 3. Optional 처리

```swift
output.cogValue
    .unwrap()
    .bind { [weak self] value in
        self?.rootView.slider.value = Float(value)
    }
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 4. TableView 바인딩

```swift
output.items
    .bind(
        to: self.rootView.tableView.rx.items(
            cellIdentifier: Cell.identifier,
            cellType: Cell.self
        )
    ) { row, element, cell in
        cell.configure(element)
    }
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 5. 조건부 UI

```swift
// 표시/숨김
output.hasData
    .map { !$0 }
    .bind(to: self.rootView.emptyView.rx.isHidden)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

// 색상 변경
output.status
    .map { status -> UIColor in
        switch status {
        case .active: return .systemGreen
        case .inactive: return .systemGray
        case .error: return .systemRed
        }
    }
    .bind(to: self.rootView.statusIndicator.rx.backgroundColor)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

### 6. 로딩 상태

```swift
output.isLoading
    .bind(to: self.rootView.activityIndicator.rx.isAnimating)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)

output.isLoading
    .map { !$0 }
    .bind(to: self.rootView.contentView.rx.isHidden)
    .disposed(by: self.disposeBag)
```

